index 51befd4..ed3b765 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,18 @@ change behaviour; such changes are listed under **Changed**).
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- Opt-in local native-GUI recording mailbox with per-take finalization, ownership-fenced Stop receipts, accepted/written frame counts, and capture-pause evidence. Tracking/calibration can remain active between separately controlled recording takes.
+
+### Fixed
+- Local MATREX integration patch: independent `--no-camera-fallback` camera
+  startup fails on acquisition/output errors without stdin supervision.
+- Camera-fallback previews disable all outputs instead of publishing sample
+  motion as if it came from the requested camera.
+
+### Added
+- Engine ZMQ messages append actual `source_kind` and `source_fallback`
+  metadata; legacy pose fields and the standalone bridge encoder are unchanged.
+
 ### Documentation
 - Link the MATREX VR experiment manual and the companion HejjéTrac/Daari Deepa toolchain, keeping tracker input distinct from experiment telemetry.
 
